.TH emanegentransportxml 1 "@RELDATE@" "emanegentransportxml @VERSION@"
.SH NAME
emanegentransportxml \- EMANE transport daemon XML generator
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B emanegentransportxml
.RI [ OPTIONS ]... " URI" " [URI]..."
.SH DESCRIPTION
.P
.B emanegentransportxml
generates XML configuration files for
.B emanetransportd
from one or more EMANE emulator platform XML files.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B URI
URI of an EMANE emulator platform XML file.
.TP
.BI \--outpath " LOCATION"
Write generated files to
.IR LOCATION .
The default is the current working directory.
.TP
.BI \--dtdpath " LOCATION"
Resolve DTD files from
.IR LOCATION .
The default is the directory from the platform XML SYSTEM declaration.
.TP
.BI \--dtd " DTD"
Validate using
.IR DTD .
The default is
.BR transport.dtd .
.TP
.B \--debug
Enable debug output.
.TP
.B \--help
Print usage information and exit.
.SH EXAMPLE
.P
Generate transport daemon configuration files from all matching platform files:
.RS
.nf
emanegentransportxml platform*.xml
.fi
.RE
.P
Example output:
.RS
.nf
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE transportdaemon SYSTEM "file://@datadir@/dtd/transportdaemon.dtd">
<transportdaemon>
  <instance nemid="1">
    <param name="platformendpoint" value="localhost:50001"/>
    <param name="transportendpoint" value="localhost:40001"/>
    <transport definition="transvirtual.xml">
      <param name="bitrate" value="0"/>
      <param name="address" value="172.30.1.1"/>
      <param name="device" value="emane0"/>
    </transport>
  </instance>
</transportdaemon>
.fi
.RE
.SH VERSION
@VERSION@
.SH BUGS
To report a bug, send email to <labs at adjacentlink dot com>.
